      "viewCalls": "7 eth_call per verification, each a fixed number of mapping lookups (sdk/verify.ts round 0 and 1, sdk/checkers.ts; contracts/src/EmissionsClaimRegistry.sol reports, shipmentStatus, remainingKg, reportScopes, isValidAt; VerifierAllowlist institutions, auditors): independent of N and M",
